UUID: 3dc4c019-1c64-33d2-962f-2e4de66707fa
Heat delivered by the boiler not including losses and electricity demand for heat circulation in the house.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Non-modulating, non-condensing boiler sold in 2000.
Time period: Estimation for efficiency of boilers sold in 2000.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in literature 
